From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:04:41 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] raumata: add MeshCore node and shared-PHY radio bridge

Add MeshCoreRadio and MeshCoreNode on top of the shared RadioInterface:

- Prepend/strip the 4-byte RAUM transport tag so MeshCore frames are demultiplexed from Meshtastic frames on the same PHY, using RadioInterface::isChannelBusy() for CAD backoff.
- Persist MeshCore identity, channels, and discovered contacts in NVS.
- Implement companion commands (device/self info with GPS coordinates and TX power, contacts CRUD/import/export, channels, direct/group text, ACK tracking, push notifications, and core/radio/packet stats).

